SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.10) with jax (>= 0.4.30), numpy (>= 1.24)
    and scipy (>= 1.10), all under permissive open-source licences.
    Optionally, for the Bayesian route only, blackjax (>= 1.7, Python >= 3.11).
    Optionally, for GPU fitting only, the CUDA build of jax, which relies on
    the proprietary NVIDIA CUDA libraries; it is never required.
VignetteBuilder: knitr
